bottomparticipants

actor Admin
boundary "Admin Dashboard UI" as UI
boundary Router
control ReportController
control AccessTokenGuard
control RolesGuard
control ReportService
entity ":ReportModel" as ReportModel
database MongoDB

Admin -> UI: 1. Open Dashboard (Reports Statistics)
activate Admin
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /reports/admin/summary
activate Router

Router -> AccessTokenGuard: 3. canActivate(request)
activate AccessTokenGuard

opt Token invalid
  AccessTokenGuard --> Router: 3.1. Deny
  Router --> UI: 3.2. 401 Unauthorized
  UI --> Admin: 3.3. Show error message
end

AccessTokenGuard --> Router: 4. Allow
deactivate AccessTokenGuard

Router -> RolesGuard: 5. checkRole(ADMIN)
activate RolesGuard

opt Role invalid
  RolesGuard --> Router: 5.1. Deny
  Router --> UI: 5.2. 403 Forbidden
  UI --> Admin: 5.3. Show error message
end

RolesGuard --> Router: 6. Allow
deactivate RolesGuard

Router -> ReportController: 7. getAdminSummary()
activate ReportController

ReportController -> ReportService: 8. getAdminSummary()
activate ReportService

ReportService -> ReportModel: 9. count open reports
activate ReportModel
ReportModel -> MongoDB: 10. countDocuments(status in open)
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ReportModel: 11. open
deactivate MongoDB
ReportModel --> ReportService: 12. open
deactivate ReportModel

ReportService -> ReportModel: 13. count new reports (last 7 days)
activate ReportModel
ReportModel -> MongoDB: 14. countDocuments(status="new", createdAt>=now-7d)
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ReportModel: 15. new7d
deactivate MongoDB
ReportModel --> ReportService: 16. new7d
deactivate ReportModel

ReportService --> ReportController: 17. {open, new7d}
deactivate ReportService

ReportController --> Router: 18. HTTP 200 response
deactivate ReportController

Router --> UI: 19. Return summary data
deactivate Router

UI --> Admin: 20. Display reports statistics
deactivate UI
deactivate Admin

@enduml